{"id": "EUVD-2026-103081", "enisaUuid": "5961f839-7a6e-31c5-944a-341d826fe188", "description": "Waynboot-mall through 2.0.0 contains a missing authentication vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to forge orders by calling the internal /callback/order/submit message-queue callback. Attackers can supply arbitrary userId, addressId and cart ids in the order JSON to create orders for any member, expose stored shipping details, clear carts, and decrement stock.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:39:24", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T20:56:19", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/waynboot-mall-unauth-callback-order-forgery-cancel-mail-relay", "https://github.com/wayn111/waynboot-mall/blob/v2.0.0/waynboot-mobile-api/src/main/java/com/wayn/mobile/framework/config/SecurityConfig.java#L66", "https://github.com/wayn111/waynboot-mall/blob/v2.0.0/waynboot-mobile-api/src/main/java/com/wayn/mobile/api/controller/callback/SubmitOrderController.java#L34-L39", "https://github.com/wayn111/waynboot-mall/blob/v2.0.0/waynboot-common/src/main/java/com/wayn/common/core/service/shop/impl/MobileOrderServiceImpl.java#L225-L307", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/waynboot-mall-through-2.0.0-unauthenticated-order-forgery-via-callback-order-submit"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111659", "GHSA-gvqp-2ghw-m8w7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "8133429f-4e9a-39ed-9ecf-8fb30aef220e", "product": {"name": "waynboot-mall", "vendor": {"name": "wayn111"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.0.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f3761ec7-65dc-3217-88ce-7c844bb4fb07", "vendor": {"name": "wayn111"}}], "isExploited": false}